  "description": "Mellow's Fly-TMC2240 StepStick based on the Trinamic TMC2240 with SPI/UART control, 12–36 V input, a 3.0 A peak current rating and 256-microstep interpolation. Features stealthChop2, spreadCycle, coolStep and stallGuard4 sensorless homing inherited from the underlying TMC2240 chip.",
